The '''Mountain''' is a large area behind the [[Village]] on the [[Hub Island]].

{{ZoneText|Climb to the top!}}

== Purpose ==
The '''Mountain''' contains various [[NPC]]s. These include {{NPCSprite|Scoop}} in a house near the top of the mountain, {{NPCSprite|Romero}} during the 5th part of the [[Romero and Juliette]] quest, and the {{NPCSprite|Wizard}} after closing [[The Breach]].

Towards the base of the Mountain, a portal to the {{Zone|Dungeon Hub}} can be found. [[Nether Wart]] can be harvested in a cave at the mouth of a waterfall, near the [[Artist's Abode]] and the [[Flower House]].

